SUB R0, R0, R0
ADDI R0, 1000, R1
LOOP_ALWAYS: SUBI R1, 1, R1
BRNZ R1, LOOP_ALWAYS
ADDI R0, 1000, R1
ADDI R0, 1, R3
LOOP_BIMODAL: AND R1, R3, R4
BRZ R4, BRANCH_SKIP_1
ADDI R10, 1, R10
BRANCH_SKIP_1: SUBI R1, 1, R1
BRNZ R1, LOOP_BIMODAL
ADDI R0, 1000, R1
ADDI R0, 3, R5
LOOP_PATTERN: AND R1, R5, R6
BRZ R6, BRANCH_SKIP_2
ADDI R11, 1, R11
BRANCH_SKIP_2: SUBI R1, 1, R1
BRNZ R1, LOOP_PATTERN
STW R10, 0x0300(R0)
STW R11, 0x0304(R0)
LDW R21, 0x0300(R0)
